WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.910
This is the deal. 120 units, five floors

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.220
over a podium, wood frame.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.450
The band is red, 1 .12, and the bank says

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.700
no.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.670
The system costs more, but the whole

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.330
system, not just the premium, earns a 50

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.130
% tax credit sold for cash that displaces

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.180
the loan. Coverage 1 .16

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.590
Rooftop Solar. The power offsets the

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.430
landlord's bill first, the surplus sells

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.200
to the grid and it earns the same credit.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.340
1 .17

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.590
A passive house envelope cuts energy

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.450
again, so the landlord takes over the

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.010
utility bill and charges a market rate

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:58.500
fee. The spread is new income 1 .22

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.680
steel and concrete instead of wood.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.990
Three more floors on the same land, the

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.680
same roof, the same foundation.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.120
A hundred and ninety -two units.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.950
Insurance falls. And every fixed expense

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.780
is now split more ways.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.380
1 .30. The band turns green.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.470
To rooftop gardens, an amenity nobody

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.770
nearby offers so the building fills

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.560
faster and keeps its tenants.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:29.040
NOI, 4 .22 million.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.060
Five moves you already know how to draw.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:35.560
The same coverage the bank asked for.

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.630
And once the deal passes, every further

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.730
credit dollar shrinks the equity check

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.980
instead of the debt.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:43.920
That is the whole idea.

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:48.960
Now it's yours. Tap Add to stack a move.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.150
Open the math to see every line that

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.920
changes. Fold what you don't need.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.120
And change any assumption under inputs.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.420
The interest rate.

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.000
The credit price. The rent.

